#TUNNEL
# Baked from `highway_130_tunnel/scene.py`: the 6x2 atlas highway_130_tunnel.png,
# 6 columns in `hex_keys::edge_names` order {n, s, ne, se, sw, nw},
# row 0 = FrontImage, row 1 = BackImage; key layout as in
# `rail_060_tunnel.dat`.  Single season.  The legacy art, with its
# winter cells in row 2, is in `highway_130_tunnel/src/`, no longer packaged.
obj=tunnel
